Multiplayer 4/4: the lockstep error reporters (frame/CRC/seed mismatch, sync error, input queue overflow, connection lost) print one [mp-lan] line each in a LAN session,
so that a test run (scripts/mp/lan_pair.py logic) can never pass silently with a drifting match.

